ok different question, who's still gotta pay me back?\", \"oh and just the ones who owe more than, like, 30 dollars\", \"right so what notes have I got in my, uh, Hyford trips notebook?\", \"and, um… Beacon?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0010\", \"v\": [[\"Could you find the Trovora dentist entry in my locker, please? Just the entry itself, not the password.\", \"Also, could you tell me what the steps are for clean the fish tank (wk 48)?\", \"Would you mind showing me only the ones that aren't done yet?\"], [\"Trovora dentist locker entry\", \"steps for clean the fish tank (wk 48)?\", \"just the unfinished ones\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0011\", \"v\": [[\"Trovora dentist password?\"], [\"umm what's the… what's the actual Trovora dentist password again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0013\", \"v\": [[\"twenty minute to-dos?\", \"delete the first\", \"no, bring it back\"], [\"Could you tell me which of my to-dos are about a twenty minute job?\", \"Would you please delete the first one?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to do that. Could you please restore it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please store my locker combination, 85376, in the locker?\"], [\"locker combination 85376, save it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0015\", \"v\": [[\"photos of Albertine?\", \"hang on — Vruwen Lane pics?\", \"back to the first one — which album?\", \"Hampi group expenses?\", \"only over fifteen\", \"total?\"], [\"I'm making a little slideshow for a friend and wanted to check — do I have any photos of Albertine in there?\", \"Oh hang on, before I forget, something else just popped into my head — can you show me the pictures taken at Vruwen Lane?\", \"Ok, going back to what we were looking at before that — the Albertine one — which album is it sitting in?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to settle up after that trip, so which expenses are in the Hampi group?\", \"That's quite a list, so to keep it manageable can you narrow it to just the ones over fifteen?\", \"Right, and so I know roughly what we're dealing with before I message everyone, what do those add up to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Distia — i phoned today, can u log that\", \"Distia Ashbury\", \"whats in my Charity folder\", \"when's my nightjar thing\"], [\"Distia, phoned today — log it\", \"Distia Ashbury\", \"Charity folder contents?\", \"nightjar — when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I've been in touch with lately, so — Distia, the friend from the gym, I phoned them today. Could you log that?\"], [\"Could you please log a call for Distia, my friend from the gym? I phoned them today.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0019\", \"v\": [[\"what docs do i have linked to Taos Yard\", \"who's comin to the lavender sale\", \"what pics did i take in Hampi\"], [\"umm what documents have I got that are, like, linked to Taos Yard?\", \"ok, uh, different thing — who's coming to the lavender sale?\", \"and what… what pictures did I take while I was in Hampi?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0020\", \"v\": [[\"find the Mads shots pls\", \"whats on my to-do list rn\"], [\"I'm putting together a birthday card and want a nice picture for it, so could you find the Mads shots I've got?\", \"Thanks — while I've got you, I keep forgetting things this week, so what's actually on my to-do list at the moment?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0023\", \"v\": [[\"what's not done yet?\", \"fish one — steps?\", \"bin them all\"], [\"umm so what've I… what haven't I done yet?\", \"ok the fish one, what are the, uh, steps for that?\", \"actually you know what, just delete all of them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0024\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan around a busy stretch coming up, so can you tell me what I've got on four days from now?\", \"Hmm, that's a bit much for one day, so let's move the first one to thursday and cancel the second one altogether.\", \"Different thing — I was tidying up earlier and might have binned something by accident, is the muffin task in the trash?\"], [\"what do i have in four days\", \"move the first one to thursday n cancel the second\", \"is the muffin task in the trash?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0026\", \"v\": [[\"compass backup codes entry\", \"stargazing total?\", \"kit one — how much?\", \"kit one — which group?\"], [\"can u find my compass backup codes entry\", \"diff q, what did the stargazing come to\", \"how much was the kit one\", \"and which group's the kit one in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0027\", \"v\": [[\"Could you log a call with Vymie for me, please? I phoned them today.\", \"It was the dog walker one, please.\", \"Could you tell me what's in my calendar on monday?\", \"And what about next week, please?\"], [\"I've been meaning to keep better notes of who I talk to — Vymie, I phoned them earlier today, could you log that for me?\", \"Oh right, there are two of them — it's the one who's my dog walker.\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to get a sense of how the start of the week looks, so what's in my calendar monday?\", \"And while we're at it, I want to see if things ease off after that, so how about next week?\"]]}","ttft_ms":21740,"type":"result","duration_ms":39444,"uuid":"11fd5619-b74b-4855-bef8-bcf2c25a33b4","ttft_stream_ms":1669,"time_to_request_ms":124,"first_content_frame_ms":1669,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21996934,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278547511.0852,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
